+- Once `origin/main` contains the accepted change, fetch `origin` and fast-forward local `main`, then remove every worker and integration worktree for that change (including ignored/untracked build products such as `node_modules` and `target`), run `git worktree prune`, and delete its local branch. Squashed integration hides ancestry, so verify integration against fetched `origin/main` (via recorded PR merge or tree/patch comparison) rather than `git branch --merged`.
